description: Phaser scene conventions for AlmostDoneStudio
globs: src/scenes/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Phaser

- One file = one scene (`Phaser.Scene` subclass)
- Never create objects in `update()` — only method calls
- Load all assets in `preload()`, never in `create()`
- No React imports inside Phaser scenes. Ever.
- Touch only: `pointermove` / `pointerdown` / `pointerup` or rexvirtualjoystick
- Scale: `Phaser.Scale.FIT` + `CENTER_BOTH`, 390×844
- Communicate with React via EventBus only
